{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "sms-api-collection-v1",
    "name": "Subscription Management System — API",
    "description": "Complete REST API collection for the Subscription Management System.\n\n## Setup\n1. Set the `base_url` variable to `http://localhost:5000`\n2. Run **Auth > Signup** or **Auth > Login** — the token is auto-saved to `jwt_token`\n3. All protected requests use `{{jwt_token}}` automatically via collection auth\n\n## Variables\n- `base_url` — API base URL (default: http://localhost:5000)\n- `jwt_token` — auto-populated by login/signup scripts\n- `product_id` — auto-populated by Create Product\n- `variant_id` — auto-populated by Add Variant\n- `plan_id` — auto-populated by Create Plan",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "jwt_token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "product_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "variant_id",
